OL,3,GNEWSAPeople invited to partake in
OL,4,Aarchitect exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtists are being invited to submit
OL,7,Fwork for an open exhibition which aims
OL,8,Fto showcase Jersey's built and natural
OL,9,Fenvironment's "identity and character".
OL,11,FThe Association of Jersey Architects
OL,12,Fsaid it was organising an exhibition, A
OL,13,FSense of Place, at the Capital House,
OL,14,FSt Helier, as part of Architecture Week
OL,15,F2026.
OL,17,FIt said the exhibition would welcome a
OL,18,Fwide range of work, including
OL,19,Farchitectural models, drawings,
OL,20,Fsketches, photography, mixed-media
OL,21,Fimages and collages of the islands
OL,22,Farchitecture.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
